sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Main as __main__.py
    participant Dataset as Dataset

    Main->>Dataset: Instantiate Dataset with params
    alt data dir does not exist
        Dataset-->>Dataset: Data dir does not exists
        Dataset-->>Main: Raise FileNotFoundError
    else data directory exists
        Dataset->>Dataset: Get classes and prepare mappings
        Dataset->>Dataset: Get filepaths based on split (train/val/test)
        
        Dataset->>Dataset: Get ground truth boxes from annotation files (XML/JSON) 

        loop for each filepath
            Dataset->>Dataset: Parse and validate annotation file
            loop for each object in a file
                Dataset->>Dataset: Read/Parse object's properties (difficult, class, box,...)
            end
            Dataset-->>Dataset: Append objects with filepath mapping 
        end
        
        Dataset-->>Main: Return Dataset instance (ready to iterate)
    end
